Package: @@PACKAGE@@
Version: @@VERSION@@
Architecture: @@ARCH@@
Maintainer: @@VENDOR@@ <maintainers@astraos.invalid>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://astraos.invalid
Depends: astraos-base (>= @@VERSION@@), bash (>= 5.0), coreutils, util-linux, procps, iproute2
Recommends: xfce4-terminal, mousepad, xdg-utils
Description: AstraOS user-facing system utilities
 The small set of AstraOS-specific tools that solve a real problem rather than
 duplicating an existing application (plan §15):
 .
  * astraos-info            system and hardware summary (in astraos-base)
  * astraos-help            where the documentation lives and how to report problems
  * astraos-welcome         first-run guidance for an installed system
  * astraos-release-info    release identity, provenance and licence pointers
  * astraos-recovery-guide  step-by-step recovery for common failures
 .
 Every utility here is deliberately additive. AstraOS does not ship a replacement for
 system settings, the package manager, or any other established component.
